{"path":"experimental/function/swap","title":"std::experimental::function<R(Args...)>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::function&lt;R(Args...)&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/function/swap","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Exchanges the stored callable objects of *this and other.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> function<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Exchanges the stored callable objects of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>.\n</p><p>The allocators of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> are not exchanged.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-libfund_ts t-until-libfund_ts_3\"><td>\n<p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>get_memory_resource<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>other.<span class=\"me1\">get_memory_resource</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span><br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-until-ts-3 t-mark-ts\">(until library fundamentals TS v3)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-libfund_ts_3\"><td>\n<p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">this<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>get_allocator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> other.<span class=\"me1\">get_allocator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-3 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v3)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> function wrapper to exchange the stored callable object with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/function","title":"std::experimental::function"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::function<R(Args...)>::swap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Exchanges the stored callable objects of *this and other."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":68,"codeBlockCount":0}
